# generate_srt_confs

A Python 3 utility for parsing a CSV file and generating static **SRT (Secure Reliable Transport)** configuration files based on the information provided in the CSV.

## Features
- Reads and validates CSV input.
- Automatically generates SRT configuration files for each entry.
- Ensures consistent formatting and static configuration output.
- Lightweight and easy to integrate into existing workflows.

## Requirements
- Python 3.7+
- Standard library only (no external dependencies)  
